# Ignore everything in this directory
*
# Except this file
!.gitignore
# ...and our own hand-written Miles declarations (not EA/RAD code, so they are
# committed: the real Miles SDK is binary-only and absent, and a fresh clone
# cannot re-fetch files we wrote ourselves).  MSS/MSS.h is the one true header
# (reconstructed API surface) and Mss.h just forwards to it; xaudio2/ is that
# API implemented over XAudio2 and FFmpeg, which is what the game links.
# miniaudio/ is the same API over miniaudio, what the game links everywhere else (C4).
!include/
!include/Mss.h
!include/MSS/
!include/MSS/MSS.h
# mss_ex_pcm.h: miniaudio's pushed-PCM voice for the movies (V1), declared beside it.
!include/MSS/mss_ex_pcm.h
# Windows links both backends: each under its own prefix (mss_backend_names.h), miles_dispatch.cpp
# owning the plain names.
!include/MSS/mss_backend_names.h
!miles_dispatch.cpp
!xaudio2/
!xaudio2/miles_xaudio2.cpp
!miniaudio/
!miniaudio/miles_miniaudio.cpp
